d":"chr_dara_whitlock","name":"Dara Whitlock","role":"supporting","description":"A 42-year-old lead charter auditor assigned to the Bastion Hulk audit berth. She is angular and unhurried, with close-cropped grey hair and a habit of reading documents twice. She has seized ledgers before and is known for being fair to the point of coldness.","home_location_id":"loc_bastion_hulk","faction_id":"fac_charter_audit","motivation":"She wants an audit finding that holds up, because a previous audit she led was overturned for relying on testimony instead of evidence.","goal":"Establish whether hulls are being hidden off the mass ledger, using only evidence that can survive appeal.","flaw":"She is so rigid about procedure that she dismisses credible evidence if it arrives outside the proper channel.","internal_conflict":"She wants to be impartial but suspects that her procedural rigidity has let past fraud slip through.","external_conflict":"Ines Valcourt and the consortium challenge the audit's authority, and the light delay slows any appeal or confirmation.","arc":"She begins as an auditor who refuses anything outside formal procedure. When Maren submits raw power-draw logs verified by Tomas Reyes, she must decide whether to accept evidence that did not come through the audit office. She chooses to accept it with an independent check on Shadow Dock, ending as an auditor who weighs the evidence itself rather than the channel it came through.","personality_traits":["methodical","impartial","reserved","exacting"],"abilities":[{"name":"Ledger Seizure Authority","description":"Empowered to seize and impound the mass ledger and associated records.","category":"social"},{"name":"Audit Analysis","description":"Cross-references mass, power and duty records to find discrepancies.","category":"mental"}]},{"id":"chr_pell_adeyemi","name":"Pell Adeyemi","role":"supporting","description":"A 26-year-old dock hand and Maren's former apprentice, who now works shifts at Shadow Dock. He is wiry 