 stalls ride with the fair, and Marrowyn's claim threatens her allies' seats.","arc":"Starts as Marrowyn's polished rival who works to block the claim. After losing a blind tasting contest to Marrowyn at the Kettle Commons, she must choose between her vanity and the Round's vote. She ends by casting the deciding vote in Marrowyn's favour and trading a favour for a place beside the Ninth Stall.","personality_traits":["elegant","competitive","shrewd","proud"],"abilities":[{"name":"Vote Counting","description":"Predicts how each stallholder will vote.","category":"social"},{"name":"Fine Palate","description":"Distinguishes blends and origins from a single sip.","category":"mental"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_marrowyn_oswin_claim","source_character_id":"chr_marrowyn_tansy","target_character_id":"chr_oswin_carter","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Marrowyn Tansy and Oswin Carter are rivals over the Ninth Stall's lease: she holds the family claim while he is secretly selling it, and each blocks the other's goal."},{"id":"rel_marrowyn_hester_rivalry","source_character_id":"chr_marrowyn_tansy","target_character_id":"chr_hester_bloom","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Marrowyn Tansy and Hester Bloom are trade rivals in the Kettle Commons, and Hester's influence over the Round's vote can decide Marrowyn's claim."},{"id":"rel_pell_marrowyn_ally","source_character_id":"chr_pell_wick","target_character_id":"chr_marrowyn_tansy","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Pell Wick helps Marrowyn Tansy by finding the misfiled Ninth Stall tag, and in turn Marrowyn gives Pell's first independent ruling a real case to decide."},{"id":"rel_oswin_pell_scrutiny","source_character_id":"chr_oswin_carter","target_character_id":"chr_pell_wick","relationship_type":"adversary","description":"Oswin Carter fears that Pell Wick's careful tag-reading will expose his hidden lease sale, so he tries to keep the Tallykeepers' attention elsewhere."},{"id":"rel_hester_oswin_ally","source_character_id":"chr_hester_bloom","target_character_id":"chr_oswin_carter","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Hester Bloom quietly backs Oswin Carter's sale of the lease, since keeping the Ninth Stall closed protects her allies' seats in the Round."}]}
